* IHP SG13G2 HBT decks — MANDATORY: without ngbehavior=hsa the npn13G2 conducts 0 current
* (silently), so every metric reads dead. Export PDK_ROOT and PDK first, e.g.
*   export PDK_ROOT=$HOME/local/pdks   PDK=ihp-sg13g2
* Self-heating VBIC .op/.ac needs ngspice >= 45 (JPP-361); on 44 use the transient tone probes.
setcs sourcepath = ( $sourcepath $PDK_ROOT/$PDK/libs.tech/ngspice/models )
set ngbehavior=hsa
